---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/baseLayout.astro";
const pageTitle = "Restaurante Ixmucare | Cocina tradicional y Naturaleza";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section
		class="relative h-[80vh] flex items-center justify-center text-center text-white overflow-hidden"
	>
		<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 z-10"></div>
		<!-- Placeholder for Hero Image - ideally a photo of the restaurant with green areas -->
		<div
			class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559339352-11d035aa65de?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80')] bg-cover bg-center"
		>
		</div>

		<div class="relative z-20 px-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
			<h1
				class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-serif font-bold mb-6 drop-shadow-lg"
			>
				Ixmucare
			</h1>
			<p class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-8 font-light drop-shadow-md">
				Donde la frescura del mar se encuentra con la belleza de la
				naturaleza en Paraíso, Tabasco.
			</p>
			<a
				href="/menu"
				class="inline-block bg-[#a3b18a] text-[#344e41] px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-[#dad7cd] transition-colors duration-300 shadow-lg"
			>
				Ver Menú
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- About Section -->
	<section class="py-12 md:py-20 px-4 bg-[#dad7cd] text-[#344e41]">
		<div
			class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center"
		>
			<div>
				<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">
					Nuestra Esencia
				</h2>
				<p class="text-lg mb-4 leading-relaxed">
					En Ixmucare, no solo servimos comida; ofrecemos una
					experiencia. Nuestra cocina tradicional de mariscos se
					prepara con los ingredientes más frescos de la región,
					honrando las recetas de antaño.
				</p>
				<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
					Todo esto en un entorno rodeado de exuberantes zonas verdes,
					diseñado para que te desconectes de la rutina y conectes con
					la naturaleza y el buen comer.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl h-96 bg-gray-300">
				<!-- Placeholder for About Image -->
				<img
					src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565299624946-b28f40a0ae38?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
					alt="Platillo de mariscos"
					class="w-full h-full object-cover"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Highlights / Menu Preview -->
	<section class="py-12 md:py-20 px-4 bg-[#fefae0]">
		<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center">
			<h2
				class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold mb-8 md:mb-12 text-[#344e41]"
			>
				Favoritos de la Casa
			</h2>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
				<!-- Card 1 -->
				<div
					class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-2xl transition-shadow duration-300"
				>
					<div class="h-64 overflow-hidden">
						<img
							src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599084993091-1a820b293b5c?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
							alt="Ceviche"
							class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"
						/>
					</div>
					<div class="p-6">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-[#3a5a40]">
							Ceviche Ixmucare
						</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-600">
							Fresco pescado marinado en cítricos con el toque
							secreto de la casa.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<!-- Card 2 -->
				<div
					class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-2xl transition-shadow duration-300"
				>
					<div class="h-64 overflow-hidden">
						<img
							src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534939561126-855b8675edd7?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
							alt="Camarones"
							class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"
						/>
					</div>
					<div class="p-6">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-[#3a5a40]">
							Camarones al Coco
						</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-600">
							Crujientes camarones empanizados con coco, servidos
							con salsa de mango.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<!-- Card 3 -->
				<div
					class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-2xl transition-shadow duration-300"
				>
					<div class="h-64 overflow-hidden">
						<img
							src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1626645738196-c2a7c87a8f58?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
							alt="Pescado Frito"
							class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"
						/>
					</div>
					<div class="p-6">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-[#3a5a40]">
							Mojarra Frita
						</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-600">
							La clásica mojarra frita, crujiente por fuera y
							jugosa por dentro.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="mt-12">
				<a
					href="/menu"
					class="inline-block border-2 border-[#3a5a40] text-[#3a5a40] px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-[#3a5a40] hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"
				>
					Ver Menú Completo
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Green Zones Section -->
	<section
		class="py-12 md:py-20 px-4 bg-[#588157] text-white relative overflow-hidden"
	>
		<div
			class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full opacity-10 pointer-events-none"
		>
			<!-- Decorative pattern or texture could go here -->
			<svg width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
				<defs>
					<pattern
						id="leaf-pattern"
						width="40"
						height="40"
						patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
					>
						<path
							d="M20 0C10 0 0 10 0 20C0 30 10 40 20 40C30 40 40 30 40 20C40 10 30 0 20 0Z"
							fill="white"></path>
					</pattern>
				</defs>
				<rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#leaf-pattern)"
				></rect>
			</svg>
		</div>
		<div
			class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center"
		>
			<div
				class="order-2 md:order-1 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl h-96"
			>
				<img
					src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585320806297-9794b3e4eeae?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
					alt="Jardín del restaurante"
					class="w-full h-full object-cover"
				/>
			</div>
			<div class="order-1 md:order-2">
				<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">
					Un Oasis Verde
				</h2>
				<p class="text-lg mb-6 text-gray-100">
					Relájate en nuestras amplias zonas verdes. Ixmucare es el
					lugar perfecto para disfrutar de una tarde soleada en
					familia, rodeado de naturaleza y aire fresco.
				</p>
				<ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
					<li class="flex items-center">
						<span class="bg-[#a3b18a] p-2 rounded-full mr-4"
							>🌿</span
						>
						<span>Áreas de juego para niños</span>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-center">
						<span class="bg-[#a3b18a] p-2 rounded-full mr-4"
							>🌺</span
						>
						<span>Jardines botánicos</span>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-center">
						<span class="bg-[#a3b18a] p-2 rounded-full mr-4"
							>☀️</span
						>
						<span>Terrazas al aire libre</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
				<a
					href="/gallery"
					class="inline-block bg-white text-[#588157] px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-[#dad7cd] transition-colors duration-300"
				>
					Ver Galería
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- CTA Section -->
	<section class="py-12 md:py-20 px-4 bg-[#344e41] text-white text-center">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">
				¿Listo para visitarnos?
			</h2>
			<p class="text-xl mb-10 text-gray-300">
				Reserva tu mesa hoy y vive la experiencia Ixmucare.
			</p>
			<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center gap-6">
				<a
					href="/contact"
					class="bg-[#a3b18a] text-[#344e41] px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-xl hover:bg-[#dad7cd] transition-colors duration-300 shadow-lg"
				>
					Contactar Ahora
				</a>
				<a
					href="tel:+529331234567"
					class="border-2 border-[#a3b18a] text-[#a3b18a] px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-xl hover:bg-[#a3b18a] hover:text-[#344e41] transition-colors duration-300"
				>
					Llamar: (933) 123 4567
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
